MOHTARAM HAI KARBALA WALON KA GHAM <br>
<br>
AAIYE MATAM KAREN IS GHAM MEIN HUM,<br>
 ASHK-O-MATAM AUR ZIKRE KARBALA,<br>
 MAJLISE SHAHE HUDA FARSHE AZA,<br>
 DAR HAQEEQAT HAI YE ZAINAB KA KARAM,<br>
 AAIYE MATAM KAREIN IS GHAM MEIN HUM<br>
<br>
KYON NA IS GHAM MEIN RAHEIN AANSO RAWAN,<br>
 FATIMA IS GHAM MEIN HAIN GIRYA KUNAN,<br>
 BASS ISI GHAM MEIN KARO HAR GHAM KO ZAM,<br>
 AAIYE MATAM KAREIN IS GHAM MEIN HUM<br>
<br>
<br>
