 KARBALA KE GHAM MEIN HUM KARTE HAIN BAIN,<br>
 YOON NAMAZ-E-GHAM ADA KARTE HAIN HUM,<br>
 AAYIE MATAM KAREN IS GHAM MEIN HUM<br>
