 KARBALA WALON KE HAIN GHAMKHAAR HUM<br>
 AAYIE MATAM KAREIN IS GHAM MEIN HUM<br>
<br>
DEKHEN HUM MASHHAD NAJAF AUR SAMERA,<br>
 KHUM MADINA KAZEMAIN-O-KARBALA,<br>
 YA ALI PARWANA-E-QASIM HAI HUM,<br>
 AAIYE MATAM KAREIN IS GHAM MEIN HUM<br>
<br>
QASIM-E-NAUSHAH TU KARLE QUBOOL,<br>
 KHOON MEIN DOOBE YE KUCH LAFZON KE PHOOL,<br>
 RAKH LE AQA APNE SHAYER KA BHARAM,<br>
 AAIYE MATAM KAREIN IS GHAM MEIN HUM<br>
<br>
<br>
TASHNA LAB NAUSHA AYE IBNE HASAN,<br>
 KHOO RULATA HAI TERA TUKDEY BADAN,<br>
 PHIRTA HAI AANKHAON MEIN AUR ROOTEY HAI HUM<br>
 AAIYE MATAM KAREIN IS GAM MEIN HUM<br>
<br>
CHHEY MAHINE WALE AYE PYASE SAGEER,<br>
 WO TERI NHANNI SI GARDAN AUR WO TEER,<br>
 KAMSINI MEIN TUHJ PE THA KAISA SITAM,<br>
 AAIYE MATAM KAREIN IS GHAM MEIN HUM<br>
<br>
JAANE-E-LAILA HUM SHABEEH-E-MUSTAFA,<br>
 MAA NE DEKHA DHOOP MEIN LAASHA TERA,<br>
 BAAP THOKAR KHA RAHA THA HAR KHADAM<br>
 AAIYE MATAM KAREIN IS GHAM MEIN HUM<br>
