AAJ YE JO MAJLISO KI SHAAN HAI,<br>
 SANIYE ZEHRA TERA EHSAAN HAI,<br>
 HUM AZADARON PE HAI TERA KARAM<br>
 AAIYE MATAM KAREIN IS GHAM MEIN HUM<br>
