 SHAAM KE ZINDAAN MEIN AAKHIR MARGAYI,<br>
 CHAAR SAALA DUKHTARE SHAHE UMMAM,<br>
 AAYIE MATAM KAREIN IS GHAM MEIN HUM<br>
